# OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Python bytecode from tools/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ---- signing material: NEVER commit ----
# These are the keys that prove you are you. A private key pushed to a public
# repository must be treated as compromised: revoke the certificate at
# developer.apple.com and generate a new one. Keep them OUTSIDE this folder;
# these patterns are a safety net, not a filing system.
dist.key
dist.csr
dist.pem
dist.p12
dist.p12.b64*
distribution.cer
*.p12
*.p8
*.mobileprovision
*.cer
AuthKey_*
